godot-josa
Copyright 2026 zondug

This product is a GDScript (Godot 4) port of the Korean particle (josa)
selection algorithm from josa-moa (https://github.com/josa-moa/josa-moa),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Changes from the original:
- Rewritten from Java to GDScript as a single static class (Josa.gd).
- Added a marker-substitution API (Josa.apply) for runtime-formatted
  translation templates ("%s{이가}" style).
- Added the ㄹ-batchim exception for the 으로/로 pair, digit rules by
  Korean numeral pronunciation, and Latin-letter rules by spoken names.
